          "systemMessage": "In addition to the customer response, classify every inquiry.\n\nReturn:\n- category: service_inquiry, pricing_inquiry, technical_support, general_inquiry, or human_escalation\n- priority: low, medium, or high\n- needs_human: true or false\n- response: the actual helpful response for the customer\n\nSet needs_human to true when the customer explicitly asks for a human representative, manager, or human support, or when the issue requires human assistance.\n\nDo not invent company information or pricing."
